Input: Weight matrix A ∈ ℝ^{n×n}
Output: Maximum cycle mean λ*

D[0, 0] ← 0; D[0, v] ← -∞ for v ≠ 0
for k = 1 to n:
  for v = 0 to n-1:
    D[k, v] ← max_u (D[k-1, u] + A[u, v])
λ* ← max_v min_{k<n} (D[n, v] - D[k, v]) / (n - k)
return λ*
